    "project.bregman-arie/devops-exercises.oneSentence": "涵盖主流运维技术栈的面试题合集，助力工程师系统备战 DevOps 面试。",
    "project.vorssaint/vorssaint-utils.descShortZh": "macOS 菜单栏工具包",
